# EclipseOS live-boot package list.
#
# live-build normally auto-generates this file with
# "live-boot live-config live-config-systemd systemd-sysv" unless it already
# exists. EclipseOS deliberately does not install live-config: hostname,
# /etc/hosts, locale, keyboard, timezone, the live user and enabled services
# are baked into the image at build time (docs/architecture.md). live-config
# would overwrite those settings at boot and would recreate a default account
# with a known password.
#
# This explicit, comment-only file stops `lb config` from generating the
# default list. The packages EclipseOS actually needs are requested by
# eclipse-base.list.chroot (live-boot, live-boot-initramfs-tools,
# systemd-sysv).
